86/005-68d88bcedc.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"613\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n居然是精灵球的形状！！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7651386/006-b40480ce1f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7651386/006-b40480ce1f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n美丽的晚霞！真是太棒了！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7651386/007-b44e40aa2c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7651386/007-b44e40aa2c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n看到鸟儿就会忍不住拍下来（笑）\n\n“这里的草坪真好吃嘎！”\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7651386/008-7b7e670215.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7651386/008-7b7e670215.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n“你带吃的吗？”\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7651386/009-776fec6c96.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7651386/009-776fec6c96.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n美丽的伦敦\n今天就要\n告别了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n谢谢你，伦敦！\n谢谢欧洲的大家！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n明天早上\n从伦敦\n前往旧金山！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ロンドンにて</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">欧州のメディアからの取材</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">本日 終了しました！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a h